<Base title="About" description="Why That Is Fishy exists and who writes it.">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>That Is Fishy is a beginner’s notebook for the aquarium hobby. I’m learning as I go, and I write each lesson down so a newcomer can learn with me.</p>
    <p>The name is spelled out as three words: <strong>that is fishy</strong>. It means fish, and it also means “something is off”, which is how a lot of aquarium problems begin.</p>
    <h2>What you’ll find here</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/knowledge-center/">Knowledge Center:</a> short articles on the basics.</li>
      <li><a href="/fishy-stories/">Fishy Stories:</a> what happens in my own tank.</li>
      <li><a href="/shops/">Shops:</a> places I have visited or ordered from.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>A note on advice</h2>
    <p>I’m not a vet or an expert. Treat everything here as one beginner’s notes, and check with experienced keepers before making big decisions about your fish.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
